ied":"2024-01-04","section":"writing","summary":"I am back in NYC, in my childhood room, writing this essay. It feels as if the past 6 months were a dream or a hallucination. It all went by so quickly and so slowly, but now it is over. I have such overwhelming love for Tbilisi and the …","title":"Goodbye Georgia","type":"writing","url":"https://jmkettle.com/writing/reflections-on-georgia/","wordCount":4273,"writingCategories":["georgia"]},{"date":"2023-11-20","kind":"page","lastModified":"2023-11-20","section":"writing","summary":"I turned 24 this Sunday and it was a crazy, wonderful, and joyous time in Tbilisi with friends and family.\nFor most of my life there was a mismatch of my perceived age and my biological age. When I was a teenager, I always felt that I was …","title":"24 Years - Some Reflections","type":"writing","url":"https://jmkettle.com/writing/24-years/","wordCount":2423,"writingCategories":["philosophy"]},{"alt":"large protest in Tbilisi with lots of smoke ","cloudflareImageId":"4ecef398-bf71-4384-6e25-ad1c321c1e00","date":"2023-10-15","image":"https://imagedelivery.net/AdXrFVpOozxXjKClzp0UEQ/4ecef398-bf71-4384-6e25-ad1c321c1e00/full","kind":"page","lastModified":"2023-10-15","section":"photos","summary":"","title":"Protest","type":"photos","url":"https://jmkettle.com/photos/protest/","wordCount":0},{"alt":"man smoking ","cloudflareImageId":"0820ea4c-5514-4f61-9a53-eceab46c0700","date":"2023-10-04","image":"https://imagedelivery.net/AdXrFVpOozxXjKClzp0UEQ/0820ea4c-5514-4f61-9a53-eceab46c0700/full","kind":"page","lastModified":"2023-10-04","section":"photos","summary":"","title":"Smoking","type":"photos","url":"https://jmkettle.com/photos/smoking/","wordCount":0},{"alt":"Girl outside church in Georgia ","cloudflareImageId":"3369d4a8-bde1-4fca-cbde-c2c02203a900","date":"2023-08-30","image":"https://imagedelivery.net/AdXrFVpOozxXjKClzp0UEQ/3369d4a8-bde1-4fca-cbde-c2c02203a900/full","kind":"page","lastModified":"2023-08-30","section":"photos","summary":"